5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! This is like a big mystery game, right? I'm so excited! How are we going to find the scary werewolf?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,Um... hello. I'm not sure how to find them. Is there a way to tell who is lying?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop being so timid, Minato! We just need to watch for anyone acting weird or trying to hide. Let's be decisive and find them fast.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Yay! Let's do our best! I think we should all share our thoughts openly. If we trust each other, we can definitely win!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Trust is a luxury we can't afford. I'll be observing your speech patterns. Any contradiction, no matter how small, will be noted.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you sound like a detective! That's so cool! Do you have a secret trick for catching bad guys?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"A detective... that sounds hard. @Takumi, do you think we should just vote for someone if we feel uneasy?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"No, that's just guessing. We need a real strategy. If the Seer finds something, they should lead us. Let's not waste time.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,I agree with Takumi! We need a plan. Maybe we can ask everyone a specific question to see how they react?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"A plan based on ""feelings"" is useless. The most logical approach is to compare the Seer's information with the behavior of the Possessed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, that's a great idea! What question should we ask? Something funny, maybe?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,I'm worried... what if the werewolf is really good at lying? I don't know if I can tell the difference.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, quit whining! Just focus. If we keep talking, the liar will eventually slip up. I'm not letting any of you get eaten.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Hehe, Takumi is so protective! Let's try to keep the atmosphere positive while we search for clues. It'll make the werewolf nervous!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Nervousness is a variable, but logic is a constant. I'll be looking for those who try too hard to blend in or steer the conversation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll be the cheerleader for everyone! Let's just have fun and hope we don't get eaten!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll try my best to help... I hope we can all stay safe.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Enough talking. Let's just get to the action. I'm ready to root out the wolf.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'm going to do my absolute best to help the village! Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Shion,,Let the game begin. I'll be watching every word you say.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
