32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I had a dream about a giant cookie!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Um... @Sakura, is it really a time for cookies? I'm a bit scared. Did something happen last night?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Focus! The Seer should have information now. If you're the Seer, speak up or give us a hint. We need to move.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Actually... I have some really bad news. I checked on someone, and it turns out Takumi is the werewolf!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was a very direct claim. @Mio, are you claiming to be the Seer? If so, your timing is remarkably aggressive.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! @Takumi is the werewolf?! No way! He's so loud and bossy, he doesn't seem like a sneaky wolf!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Minato,,@Mio... are you sure? I don't want to vote for Takumi if it's a mistake. How can you be so certain?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! @Mio, you're lying through your teeth! I'm not the werewolf! You're just trying to frame me to save yourself!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm not lying! I'm the Seer, and the result was clear. Takumi, please stop trying to trick us!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Interesting. A direct accusation on Day 1. Either Mio is the Seer, or she's a very bold Werewolf or Possessed trying to eliminate a threat.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, this is getting intense! @Mio seems so sure of herself. Maybe she really is the Seer?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I... I don't know who to believe. @Takumi sounds really angry, but @Mio sounds so sad. This is confusing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, don't be fooled by her act! She's playing you! @Mio, your logic is garbage. Why would a Seer reveal themselves so early?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Because we can end this right now! If we execute the werewolf today, we all win! Why wait and let more people get hurt?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi's reaction is emotional, which is expected. However, @Mio's claim is a high-risk, high-reward play. Let's analyze the probability.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I think I'll trust @Mio! She seems so honest. Sorry Takumi, but the Seer says so!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I'm still not sure... but if everyone else thinks so, maybe I should too? I'm sorry, Takumi.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,You idiots! You're just handing the win to the wolf! I'm the only one actually thinking here! Vote for Mio!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mio,,"It's okay to be scared, but please trust me! Let's vote for Takumi and save the village!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
